]},{"provider":"mal","id":"567","episodeNumbers":[19]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"18241","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"73988","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"100107","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{},"tvdb":{"title":"Eyewitness","synopsis":"Someone is killing androids in Paradigm City. After several attacks, Paradigm HQ dispatches a special agent to assist in the case: Freddy O'Reilly. But Freddy is an android himself. He and Dastun have an uneasy working relationship. When Dorothy is targeted, she manages to avoid being destroyed and is taken in for police questioning.","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}},"synopsis":"Someone is killing androids in Paradigm City. After several attacks, Paradigm HQ dispatches a special agent to assist in the case: Freddy O'Reilly. But Freddy is an android himself. He and Dastun have an uneasy working relationship. When Dorothy is targeted, she manages to avoid being destroyed and is taken in for police questioning.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/73988/136223.jpg"},{"title":"Stripes","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8941","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"567","episodeNumbers":[20]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"18241","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"73988","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"100108","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{},"tvdb":{"title":"Stripes","synopsis":"Roger is still having strange flashbacks. He can only assume that they are memories, but he's not quite sure. Frustrated, he returns to visit Gordon Rosewater, the man who built Paradigm City, on his farm. Gordon only offers vague platitudes and cryptic responses, until he gives Roger one very important clue.","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}},"synopsis":"Roger is still having strange flashbacks. He can only assume that they are memories, but he's not quite sure. Frustrated, he returns to visit Gordon Rosewater, the man who built Paradigm City, on his farm. Gordon only offers vague platitudes and cryptic responses, until he gives Roger one very important clue.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/73988/136224.jpg"},{"title":"The Third Big","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8941","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"567","episodeNumbers":[21]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"18241","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"73988","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"100109","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{},"tvdb":{"title":"The Third Big","synopsis":"Roger Smith & Dan Dastun race to R. Dorothy's aid, while Alex Rosewater finally unveils \"\"Big Fau\"\". But can he control the power of a MegaDeus once it is unleashed?","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}},"synopsis":"Roger Smith & Dan Dastun race to R. Dorothy's aid, while Alex Rosewater finally unveils \"\"Big Fau\"\". But can he control the power of a MegaDeus once it is unleashed?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/73988/136225.jpg"},{"title":"Hydra","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8941","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"567","episodeNumbers":[22]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"18241","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"73988","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"100110","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{},"tvdb":{"title":"Hydra","synopsis":"Roger is unsympathetic to Alex's problems. Alex pushes his science group to reactivate the Big Fau. Underground tremors and a power outage draw attention to these tests, and the union spy Vera unleashes a three-headed giant electric eel. Once again, Roger and the Big O find themselves facing a giant monster to protect all of Paradigm City.","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}},"synopsis":"Roger is unsympathetic to Alex's problems. Alex pushes his science group to reactivate the Big Fau. Underground tremors and a power outage draw attention to these tests, and the union spy Vera unleashes a three-headed giant electric eel. Once again, Roger and the Big O find themselves facing a giant monster to protect all of Paradigm City.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/73988/136226.jpg"},{"title":"Twisted Memories","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8941","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"567","episodeNumbers":[23]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"18241","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"73988","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"100111","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{},"tvdb":{"title":"Twisted Memories","synopsis":"Beck!!!!! I love it when that guy shows up; it makes me feel all alliterative inside. Let's see... Beck's back, with an army of annoying android assassins [oh yeah, it's gonna be one of *those* episodes]. Alex Rosewater deals with his Daddy Issues in a very negative way [so long, Amber Waves of Grain(tm)], while at the same using Beck to kidnap R. Dorothy. And we're just gettin' warmed up...","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}},"synopsis":"Beck!!!!! I love it when that guy shows up; it makes me feel all alliterative inside. Let's see... Beck's back, with an army of annoying android assassins [oh yeah, it's gonna be one of *those* episodes]. Alex Rosewater deals with his Daddy Issues in a very negative way [so long, Amber Waves of Grain(tm)], while at the same using Beck to kidnap R. Dorothy. And we're just gettin' warmed up...","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/73988/136227.jpg"},{"title":"The Big Fight","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8941","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"567","episodeNumbers":[24]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"18241","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"73988","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"100112","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{},"tvdb":{"title":"The Big Fight","synopsis":"Roger Smith and Big O slug it out with Alan Gabriel and \"\"Big Duo Inferno\"\" (hereafter referred to simply as \"\"Big Duo\"\"), while Alex Rosewater uses R. Dorothy's Memories to complete Big Fau. And the Union is still out there...","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}},"synopsis":"Roger Smith and Big O slug it out with Alan Gabriel and \"\"Big Duo Inferno\"\" (hereafter referred to simply as \"\"Big Duo\"\"), while Alex Rosewater uses R. Dorothy's Memories to complete Big Fau. And the Union is still out there...","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/73988/136228.jpg"},{"title":"The War of Paradigm City","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8941","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"567","episodeNumbers":[25]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"18241","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"73988","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"100113","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{},"tvdb":{"title":"The War of Paradigm City","synopsis":"When high-altitude bombing levels Paradigm City, Alex Rosewater proclaims his \"\"New Order\"\". Meanwhile, Roger Smith and Angel uncover the soul-shattering secrets behind the Event, and the founding of Paradigm City.","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}},"synopsis":"When high-altitude bombing levels Paradigm City, Alex Rosewater proclaims his \"\"New Order\"\". Meanwhile, Roger Smith and Angel uncover the soul-shattering secrets behind the Event, and the founding of Paradigm City.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/73988/136229.jpg"},{"title":"The Show Must Go On","episodeNumber":13,"sourceEpisodeNumber":13,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"8941","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"mal","id":"567","episodeNumbers":[26]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"18241","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"73988","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[13]}],"link":"100114","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{},"tvdb":{"title":"The Show Must Go On","synopsis":"From the cover of \"\"Scientific American\"\", August 2003... \"\"ARE YOU A HOLOGRAM? (Quantum physics says the entire universe might be)\"\" Now just imagine if that was really the case, and you'll have \"\"The Show Must Go On\"\" in a nutshell, which is apparently where Paradigm City has been all these years. As for the rest... R. Dorothy rises from her deathbed, thanks (in part) to Beck. Roger Smith and Alex Rosewater stage the Showdown of the Century, while Gordon Rosewater shows Angel her true destiny. Oh, and that little prank by Adult Swim? We are not amused.","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}},"synopsis":"From the cover of \"\"Scientific American\"\", August 2003... \"\"ARE YOU A HOLOGRAM? (Quantum physics says the entire universe might be)\"\" Now just imagine if that was really the case, and you'll have \"\"The Show Must Go On\"\" in a nutshell, which is apparently where Paradigm City has been all these years. As for the rest... R. Dorothy rises from her deathbed, thanks (in part) to Beck. Roger Smith and Alex Rosewater stage the Showdown of the Century, while Gordon Rosewater shows Angel her true destiny. Oh, and that little prank by Adult Swim? We are not amused.","thu